# Position loop for the tune_v4 attitude response (log 00000043, 2026-11-03). tune_v4 removed the
# 2.3 Hz rocking (angle RMS 0.40-0.46 -> 0.28-0.30 deg) and the heading wobble (1.93 -> 0.33 deg),
# at about +22 ms of attitude response delay at 1-3 rad/s (tools/tuning/attitude_design.py:
